#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""FS3 v216 - beams on their orb, steady brackets, FreeSpace explosions
(Silvio, 11.10.2026).

    Beams      The ray under the hulls and the orb on top used different
    Brackets   turret points whenever a frame ran 3 or more game steps
               (25 ms or longer): "drawn from her model" was counted in
               steps, so such a frame took every ship for flat until she
               was drawn again. Ray, hit outline (hullView) and target box
               went back to the flat point (measured: every such frame, up
               to ~790 units on the Ravana; her box 535 against 664 px).
               Now counted in pictures (F3D_FRAME, f3dFresh).
    Lock ring  One size on the screen (LOCK_RING_R), as in FreeSpace.
    Explosions The MediaVP 5.0.2 animations (Exp05, Exp20, ParticleSmoke01)
               instead of drawn fireballs, sized to the ship; a capital
               ship goes up along her whole hull and ends in the big blast
               with a flash and a ring (Silvio: C with the flash of B).
    Trails     Missiles leave the FS trail (MissileTrail01) with smoke.

Needs v215. Edits src/20_render.js, 59_field3d.js, 60_effects.js,
70_ui.js, 72_target.js, fieldsim.js (v204 test: pictures);
new src/63_fxanim.js (sheets inside, base64).
Run assemble.py 216 afterwards.
"""
import base64
import os
import sys

if "F3D_FRAME" in open("src/59_field3d.js", encoding="utf-8").read():
    sys.exit("v216 ist schon eingespielt.")
if "DMG_REBUILD_STEPS" not in open("src/20_render.js", encoding="utf-8").read():
    sys.exit("Abbruch: erst v215 einspielen.")

F = {}
def load(p):
    if p not in F: F[p] = open(p, encoding="utf-8").read()
def rep(p, old, new, count=1):
    load(p)
    n = F[p].count(old)
    if n != count:
        sys.exit("Abbruch (%s): Suchtext %d-mal gefunden, erwartet %d.\n%s" % (p, n, count, old[:200]))
    F[p] = F[p].replace(old, new)
